{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>אם</b> — to confirm the matter." "<b>אחרית</b> — that you will live, and אחרית is an allusion to old age, or to his children who remain after him." "<b>ותקותך</b> — that your hope is to El, to do good to you."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:20.418714582Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}